) was founded in 1843 by Frederick T. Stanley and incorporated in Connecticut in 1852. In March 2010, the Company completed a merger with The Black & Decker Corporation (\"Black & Decker\"), a company founded by S. Duncan Black and Alonzo G. Decker and incorporated in Maryland in 1910. At that time, the Company changed its name from The Stanley Works to Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. The Company's principal executive office is located at 1000 Stanley Drive, New Britain, Connecticut 06053 and its telephone number is (860) 225-5111.","zh":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.（「公司」）由 Frederick T. Stanley 於 1843 年創立，並於 1852 年在康乃狄克州註冊成立。 2010 年 3 月，公司完成了與 The Black & Decker Corporation（「Black & Decker」）的合併，後者由 S. Duncan Black 和 Alonzo G. Decker 創立，於 1910 年在馬裡蘭州註冊成立。當時，公司名稱從 The Stanley Works 更名為 Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. 該公司的主要執行辦公室位於 1000 Stanley Drive, New Britain, Connecticut 06053，電話號碼為 (860) 225-5111。"},{"en":"The Company is a global provider of hand tools, power tools, outdoor products and related accessories, as well as a leading provider of engineered fastening solutions, with 2025 consolidated annual revenues of $15.1 billion. Approximately 62% of the Company's 2025 revenues were generated in the United States, with the remainder largely from Europe (16%), emerging markets (13%) and Canada (4%).","zh":"該公司是手動工具、電動工具、戶外產品及相關配件的全球供應商，也是工程緊固解決方案的領先供應商，2025 年綜合年收入為 151 億美元。公司 2025 年收入中約 62% 來自美國，其餘大部分來自歐洲 (16%)、新興市場 (13%) 和加拿大 (4%)。"},{"en":"In recent years, the Company has re-shaped its portfolio through a series of divestitures. In July 2022, the Company sold its Convergent Security Solutions (\"CSS\") business comprised of the commercial electronic security and healthcare businesses for net proceeds of $3.1 billion and its Mechanical Access Solutions (\"MAS\") business comprised of the automatic doors business for net proceeds of $916 million. In August 2022, the Company sold its Oil & Gas business comprised of the pipeline services and equipment businesses. In April 2024, the Company sold its Infrastructure business, comprised of the attachment and handheld hydraulic tools business, for net proceeds of $729 million. Most recently, the Company announced in December 2025 that it had entered into a definitive agreement to sell its Consolidated Aerospace Manufacturing (\"CAM\") business for $1.8 billion in cash. These divestitures","zh":"近年來，該公司透過一系列資產剝離重新塑造了其投資組合。 2022年7月，該公司以31億美元的淨收益出售了由商業電子安全和醫療保健業務組成的融合安全解決方案（「CSS」）業務，並以9.16億美元的淨收益出售了由自動門業務組成的機械門禁解決方案（「MAS」）業務。 2022年8月，公司出售了由管道服務和設備業務組成的石油和天然氣業務。 2024年4月，該公司出售了其基礎設施業務，包括配件和手持式液壓工具業務，淨收益為7.29億美元。最近，該公司於 2025 年 12 月宣布，已簽訂最終協議，以 18 億美元現金出售其聯合航空製造（「CAM」）業務。這些資產剝離"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"A significant portion of the Company's Tools & Outdoor products are sold to home centers and mass merchants in the U.S. and Europe. A consolidation of retailers both in North America and abroad has occurred over time. While this consolidation and the domestic and international expansion of these large retailers have provided the Company with opportunities for growth, the increasing size and importance of individual customers create a certain degree of exposure to potential sales volume loss. The Home Depot accounted for approximately 15% and 14% of the Company's consolidated net sales in 2025 and 2024, respectively, while Lowe's accounted for approximately 12% and 14% of the Company's consolidated net sales in 2025 and 2024, respectively. No other customer exceeded 10% of the Company's consolidated net sales in 2025 or 2024.","zh":"該公司的工具和戶外產品很大一部分銷往美國和歐洲的家居中心和大眾商家。隨著時間的推移，北美和國外的零售商不斷整合。雖然這些大型零售商的整合以及國內和國際擴張為公司提供了成長機會，但個人客戶規模和重要性的不斷增加在一定程度上造成了潛在銷售損失的風險。家得寶分別占公司2025年和2024年綜合淨銷售額的約15%和14%，勞氏分別占公司2025年和2024年綜合淨銷售額的約12%和14%。沒有其他客戶超過公司2025年或2024年合併淨銷售額的10%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Company competes on the basis of its reputation for innovation and product quality, its well-known brands, its commitment to customer service, its strong customer relationships, the breadth of its product lines focused on core end-user segments, and customer value propositions.","zh":"該公司的競爭基礎是其創新和產品品質的聲譽、知名品牌、對客戶服務的承諾、牢固的客戶關係、專注於核心最終用戶細分市場的產品線的廣度以及客戶價值主張。"},{"en":"The Company encounters active competition in the Tools & Outdoor and Engineered Fastening segments from both larger and smaller companies that offer the same or similar products and services or that produce different products appropriate for the same uses. Certain large customers offer private label brands (\"house brands\") that compete across a wide spectrum of the Company's Tools & Outdoor segment product offerings.","zh":"該公司在工具和戶外以及工程緊固領域遇到來自大小公司的激烈競爭，這些公司提供相同或相似的產品和服務，或生產適合相同用途的不同產品。某些大客戶提供自有品牌（「自有品牌」），這些品牌在公司的工具和戶外產品領域進行廣泛的競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-03","items":[{"name":"Tools & Outdoor","val":13158200000,"zh":"工具及戶外部門"},{"name":"Engineered Fastening","val":1972200000,"zh":"工程緊固部門"}],"total":15130400000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-03","items":[{"name":"US","val":9316800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":3079800000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":1213900000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":839600000,"zh":"其他美洲"},{"name":"CA","val":680300000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":15130400000}},"peers":["DOV","PPG","GPC","GWW","VFC"]}}